  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Area- Focused Network Plus Call - Rising from the Depths: Utilising Marine Cultural Heritage in East Africa to help develop sustainable social, economic and cultural benefits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Utilising Marine Cultural Heritage to help stimulate, ethical, inclusive and sustainable growth in the east Africa. Benefits local populationsand NGOs in Kenya, Tanzania, Mozambique and Madagascar. SDGs 11,14,13</narrative>
  </description>
